      "text": "Ready, bro?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 9.1,
      "end_time": 11.3,
      "text": "Yeah. All ready, bro"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 11.6,
      "end_time": 16.6,
      "text": "Although, to be honest, I'm not that much of a help in a fight."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 18.0,
      "end_time": 19.3,
      "text": "Fulfilled Desires"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 20.2,
      "end_time": 21.5,
      "text": "...Heheh"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 23.7,
      "end_time": 24.6,
      "text": "Let's do it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 25.7,
      "end_time": 26.5,
      "text": "Indeed!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 26.7,
      "end_time": 28.5,
      "text": "...Go ahead and SMASH IT!!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 28.7,
      "end_time": 30.3,
      "text": "Al-Huma! Wind Spirit!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 35.6,
      "end_time": 37.5,
      "text": "Kyaru, I'm going to have you work your ass off"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 38.3,
      "end_time": 41.5,
      "text": "How do you get off acting so smug, Ram?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 44.7,
      "end_time": 46.5,
      "text": "I knew it. By virtue of being that big..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 46.7,
      "end_time": 49.3,
      "text": "It's hard to drop it with magic...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 49.6,
      "end_time": 54.0,
      "text": "There's no issue with that, Lady Kyaru. We were able to get its attention as planned"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 59.7,
      "end_time": 61.2,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 63.8,
      "end_time": 65.8,
      "text": "Kokkoro, keep it together"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 66.2,
      "end_time": 67.7,
      "text": "El Fula!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 68.2,
      "end_time": 69.6,
      "text": "I shall, Lady Ram!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 70.5,
      "end_time": 74.0,
      "text": "O'raging winds, bring them to untold heights...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 76.3,
      "end_time": 78.2,
      "text": "Thank you, everyone"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 79.2,
      "end_time": 81.1,
      "text": "Let's go, guys"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 88.0,
      "end_time": 91.7,
      "text": "Emilia! I'd like to work with you for this big one!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 92.2,
      "end_time": 94.3,
      "text": "Yes, leave it to me, Pecorine!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 94.7,
      "end_time": 96.2,
      "text": "Are you ready, Puck?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 96.4,
      "end_time": 100.1,
      "text": "Of course! Time for your combination technique! I'll do my best~♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 105.6,
      "end_time": 106.4,
      "text": "Full power!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 106.6,
